{"2905910":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hold The Levee","steam_appid":2905910,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Water always finds a way<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the Levee simulates water on every cell of the map: it runs downhill, fills hollows, pushes against levees<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and seeps through embankments. Every trench changes the river's course, every levee can leak, and every dam can break.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign: 24 missions<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trenches, mills and turbines: make power from the difference in water levels.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flood wave: sandbags, levees and pumps before the water reaches the village.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm on the coast, a cascade of dams, a flood in a medieval city.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A valley with a railway: culverts under the embankment, a polder, debris on the bridge piers and trains on schedule.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter: the river freezes, and in the thaw the floes pile up into an ice jam under the bridge.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roles reversed: you are the water. Breach the levee and flood the town hall defended by an AI crew.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend the Village<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river rises higher every time. Between waves you have time and a budget: levees, walls, gates, pumps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forecast shows when the water from the mountains will arrive. The village grows with every wave you survive — how long can you hold?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flood the Village<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI workers stack sandbags, build walls and pumps, and patch your trenches. You have a shovel, charges and a river.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two players<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Water vs Defender”: one player floods the town hall, the other defends it. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Defend Together”: a shared budget against ever higher waves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns at one computer or play online with a Steam friend.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox and map editor<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tool with no limits: raise and lower terrain, add water, send a storm to the mountains or a hard frost.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share a finished map with a short code — friends paste it in and play on your landscape.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Also<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily challenge: the same random valley for every player, with a Steam leaderboard.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards for every mission (who saved the town for the least money?).<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay of the last 20 seconds and GIF export with one key.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo (Ctrl+Z) with a refund.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop: community maps, missions, rule mods and translations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >102 Steam achievements.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Polish, German, Italian, Spanish, Russian and Simplified Chinese.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Water always finds a way<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the Levee simulates water on every cell of the map: it runs downhill, fills hollows, pushes against levees<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and seeps through embankments. Every trench changes the river's course, every levee can leak, and every dam can break.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign: 24 missions<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trenches, mills and turbines: make power from the difference in water levels.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flood wave: sandbags, levees and pumps before the water reaches the village.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm on the coast, a cascade of dams, a flood in a medieval city.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A valley with a railway: culverts under the embankment, a polder, debris on the bridge piers and trains on schedule.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter: the river freezes, and in the thaw the floes pile up into an ice jam under the bridge.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roles reversed: you are the water. Breach the levee and flood the town hall defended by an AI crew.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend the Village<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river rises higher every time. Between waves you have time and a budget: levees, walls, gates, pumps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forecast shows when the water from the mountains will arrive. The village grows with every wave you survive — how long can you hold?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flood the Village<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI workers stack sandbags, build walls and pumps, and patch your trenches. You have a shovel, charges and a river.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two players<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Water vs Defender”: one player floods the town hall, the other defends it. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Defend Together”: a shared budget against ever higher waves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns at one computer or play online with a Steam friend.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox and map editor<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tool with no limits: raise and lower terrain, add water, send a storm to the mountains or a hard frost.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share a finished map with a short code — friends paste it in and play on your landscape.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Also<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily challenge: the same random valley for every player, with a Steam leaderboard.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards for every mission (who saved the town for the least money?).<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay of the last 20 seconds and GIF export with one key.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo (Ctrl+Z) with a refund.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop: community maps, missions, rule mods and translations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >102 Steam achievements.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Polish, German, Italian, Spanish, Russian and Simplified Chinese.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Dig trenches, raise levees, stack sandbags and build dams, then watch what the water does. Hold the Levee is a game about real water physics: seepage, undermined walls, flood waves, ice jams and 24 missions, from defending a town to flooding villages guarded by the AI.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Polish, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/6d4bfb8d2266774387b4e98ca16d8a1965ed13ca\/header.jpg?t=1793738006","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/b145e91f57c5c356ba3ea5b4f2136225d1f7ad80\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793738006","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/b145e91f57c5c356ba3ea5b4f2136225d1f7ad80\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793738006","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual Core 2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any with Direct3D 11 \/ OpenGL 3.3<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad Core 3 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Trash Fox Studios"],"publishers":["Trash Fox Studios"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":699,"final":594,"discount_percent":15,"initial_formatted":"$6.99","final_formatted":"$5.94"},"packages":[1035587],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Hold The Levee","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1035587,"percent_savings_text":"-15% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Hold The Levee - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$6.99<\/span> $5.94","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":594}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":37,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen PvP"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":39,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen Co-op"},{"id":24,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/873547f6fb5782d62e6d7343e848642c8fd0a70c\/ss_873547f6fb5782d62e6d7343e848642c8fd0a70c.600x338.jpg?t=1793738006","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/873547f6fb5782d62e6d7343e848642c8fd0a70c\/ss_873547f6fb5782d62e6d7343e848642c8fd0a70c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793738006"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/6a6e08c54b8a361a8125e00f440119c4d1db001a\/ss_6a6e08c54b8a361a8125e00f440119c4d1db001a.600x338.jpg?t=1793738006","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/6a6e08c54b8a361a8125e00f440119c4d1db001a\/ss_6a6e08c54b8a361a8125e00f440119c4d1db001a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793738006"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/4c4006bcacd346b4532d711a266578bfae474bd0\/ss_4c4006bcacd346b4532d711a266578bfae474bd0.600x338.jpg?t=1793738006","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/4c4006bcacd346b4532d711a266578bfae474bd0\/ss_4c4006bcacd346b4532d711a266578bfae474bd0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793738006"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/90a2b8cec2f40c8471d780027adbcdb3a571bd53\/ss_90a2b8cec2f40c8471d780027adbcdb3a571bd53.600x338.jpg?t=1793738006","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/90a2b8cec2f40c8471d780027adbcdb3a571bd53\/ss_90a2b8cec2f40c8471d780027adbcdb3a571bd53.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793738006"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2905910\/38c4196fd43947b898b0bad5fa14a39d7e971352\/ss_38c